@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Monthly rent (EXPENSE category 7), first posting on the given date
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionType":"EXPENSE","categoryId":7,"amount":6500.00,"frequency":"MONTHLY","startDate":"2026-11-01","description":"Rent"}

### Monthly salary with an end date (INCOME category 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionType":"INCOME","categoryId":1,"amount":15000.00,"frequency":"MONTHLY","startDate":"2026-10-30","endDate":"2027-06-30","description":"Salary"}

### Invalid frequency -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionType":"EXPENSE","categoryId":7,"amount":100,"frequency":"FORTNIGHTLY","startDate":"2026-11-01"}

### Income category on an EXPENSE schedule -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionType":"EXPENSE","categoryId":1,"amount":100,"frequency":"WEEKLY","startDate":"2026-11-01"}

### List / pause / resume
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions/1/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions/1/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### What has this schedule posted so far?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ADMIN: run the daily job now (schedules due today or earlier will post)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recurring-transactions/run-due
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
